Mappings below are annotations; numbers are read from pinned source bytes.
All amounts used by the arithmetic engine are exact rational USD amounts.
Revalidation rebuilds from sources, so editing an observation's metadata cannot
change its source meaning. This is a case adapter, not a general XBRL processor.
